  "我\twǒ": "/audio/me-word.mp3",
  "我一般七点起床。\twǒyìbānqīdiǎnqǐchuáng": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/dc97178926e80c3e46172248.mp3",
  "我一般早上七点起床。\twǒyìbānzǎoshangqīdiǎnqǐchuáng": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/2a4d6c526deb885b38869269.mp3",
  "我今天看电脑太久了，眼睛有点儿疼。\twǒjīntiānkàndiànnǎotàijiǔleyǎnjingyǒudiǎnrténg": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/bbdf1a122f079a717b58d173.mp3",
  "我们\twǒmen": "/audio/hsk1-222-word.mp3",
  "我们一起去吃饭吧。\twǒmenyìqǐqùchīfànba": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/60785b15ac83ab4753ad1b66.mp3",
  "我们坐地铁去机场吧。\twǒmenzuòdìtiěqùjīchǎngba": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/b5b39be191786a56b217816b.mp3",
  "我们想订两间房。\twǒmenxiǎngdìngliǎngjiānfáng": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/eef1f0cb229ed4923a078aa1.mp3",
  "我们正聊天，画面突然卡住了。\twǒmenzhèngliáotiānhuàmiàntūránkǎzhùle": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/59a5dd40a4267e6287eb10d6.mp3",
  "我先收拾房间，你去买菜吧。\twǒxiānshōushifángjiānnǐqùmǎicàiba": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/3e5966b6d9e7b0efbef55e6e.mp3",
  "我刚出门，突然下起雨来。\twǒgāngchūméntūránxiàqǐyǔlái": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/d017b8165481a0c1348292dd.mp3",
  "我去一下洗手间，马上回来。\twǒqùyíxiàxǐshǒujiānmǎshànghuílai": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/cda63f9045622312f64e1914.mp3",
  "我只有零钱，可以吗？\twǒzhǐyǒulíngqiánkěyǐma": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/c0e1bd227d3797734c43c344.mp3",
  "我可以用手机付款吗？\twǒkěyǐyòngshǒujīfùkuǎnma": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/8f1fe5ec5f7329bc5d60b30e.mp3",
  "我在找卫生间。\twǒzàizhǎowèishēngjiān": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/3cd519f4462101e3821a3e55.mp3",
  "我在这里交了几个新朋友。\twǒzàizhèlǐjiāolejǐgexīnpéngyou": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/687f8c015a39fe11f142d9ae.mp3",
  "我家离北京很远，坐飞机要三个小时。\twǒjiālíběijīnghěnyuǎnzuòfēijīyàosāngexiǎoshí": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/a32a86eda630f56a046b62f8.mp3",
  "我得先打扫房间，客人快到了。\twǒděixiāndǎsǎofángjiānkèrénkuàidàole": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/bd5e4e6289385a41c47e9a70.mp3",
  "我得去银行取点儿钱。\twǒděiqùyínhángqǔdiǎnrqián": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/ffeeb38ee638e0dbc8ef4423.mp3",
  "我的房间号是三零二。\twǒdefángjiānhàoshìsānlíngèr": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/1a6b29a070d9f5389328e035.mp3",
  "我的手机找不到了，你看见了吗？\twǒdeshǒujīzhǎobùdàolenǐkànjiànlema": "/atlas/word-trial/audio/e142c539bec11a7f8cdd5d68.mp3",
